{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1396600-forum-game-who-am-i-redux","id":1396600,"title":"Forum Game: Who Am I? Redux","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-14T21:01:53-07:00","id":1396600,"title":"Forum Game: Who Am I? Redux","content":"Original Thread: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/658193-forum-game-who-am-i\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-game-who-am-i</a><br /> <br /> Simply put: write up a character from pop culture or a work of fiction or whatever, and the next person up has to guess who it is. Bonus points if you do multiple writeups of the same character with different splats, i.e. Batman as a Lunar, then a Solar, then an Abyssal. (Yes, I've got the obvious one out of the way. Hah.)<br /> I'll start:<br /> <br /> FIRST AMONG MEN is a Zenith who has recently come to the North. The strange thing is that he claims to have been born in a land beyond the Wyld, where his family is buried after a great disaster. At first many suspected him of being raksha or worse, but he quickly dispelled their suspicion and has protected wide swathes of the North from threats ranging from hungry ghost plagues to a number of Infernals. The children of Whitewall now watch the skies eagerly for any sign of First Among Equals, bounding overhead to keep an eye on them all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-15T10:13:13-07:00","id":1396689,"title":"","content":"I always have a soft spot for SUPERMAN. For my entry, I'll use a character I actually played:<br /> <br /> THE GHOST IN THE GLASS is a Night Caste born in Chiaroscuro, forever torn between several public faces. He's the leader of a neighborhood watch gang, a poet, a playwright, a masked vigilante, and the mystery Solar whose iconic anima--a suit of knightly armor--conceals his face. He's pale to the point of real suffering under the hot Southern sun, and he wears a pair of smoked-glass lenses to protect his light-sensitive eyes. His story is a series of &quot;good ideas at the time,&quot; leading up to an inevitable conflict between his desire to do good and to just live a normal life. Ultimately, he will rise to the occasion, but until that time comes, his identity crisis continues to spiral. He covers that by wisecracking <i>constantly.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}